  "resolution_html": "<ol>\n<li>Address your email message to <a href=\"mailto:listserv@yorku.ca\">listserv@yorku.ca</a></li>\n<li>In the body of your email message, issue the command:</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>SIGNOFF</strong> <em>listname</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>where</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>SIGNOFF</strong> is the command you issue to signoff a list.<br/><em>listname </em>is the name of the list from which you want to signoff</p>\n</blockquote>",
